# Tabby config — LuicipherOS v0.1.
# Tabby is configured via its GUI (Settings); this repo ships NO config.yaml
# on purpose — a shipped (even comments-only) file broke Tabby's theme
# resolution on first run (null 'appearance' crash, VM smoke Sep 2026).
# Vanilla defaults win; back up ~/.config/tabby/config.yaml yourself if
# you customize.
# Why Tabby over kitty: built-in SSH connection manager + tabs for heavy SSH
# work, xterm-compatible TERM (no remote terminfo installs needed).
# Bind: SUPER+T (see hypr/lua/binds.lua + lua/variables.lua).
